  "title": "Bridge2AI Releases Flagship Voice Dataset",
  "bodyHtml": "<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Bridge2AI</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://bridge2ai.org/voice/\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>Precision Public Health</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> project released Bridge2AI-Voice v1.0, an ethically generated flagship voice database. The Precision Public Health project aims to leverage artificial intelligence to use voice as a biomarker for improved screening, diagnosis, and treatment of disease. The database contains 12,523 voice recordings from 306 adult North American participants with conditions known to affect voice, including respiratory disorders, vocal disorders, mood disorders, and neurological disorders. The voice recordings have been converted into de-identified spectrograms and coupled with clinical, demographic, and validated questionnaire data to inform downstream research. Users can register to access the database</span><a style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://healthdatanexus.ai/content/b2ai-voice/1.0/\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(70, 120, 134);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><u>here</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-emoji:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-position:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></p>",
  "summary": "The Bridge2AI Precision Public Health project released Bridge2AI-Voice v1.0, an ethically generated flagship voice database.",
